# Route: guide 28 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 46 to 48, 23
# quests, 2.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Blasted Lands): Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery ->
# Darkshire -> Brightwood Grove -> The Yorgen Farmstead -> Vul'Gol Ogre Mound
# -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill Cemetery -> Addle's Stead -> Darkshire -> Raven
# Hill Cemetery -> Nethergarde Keep -> Garrison Armory -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Mor'Ladim (228; Mor'Ladim 35).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377),
# Nekrum's Medallion (2991).

